So today's plan is very simple.

26
00:01:09,900 --> 00:01:12,060
We're going to try to
answer this question.

27
00:01:12,060 --> 00:01:14,330
What does it take
to train a good LLM?

28
00:01:14,330 --> 00:01:16,670
So it's one question,
but it's very loaded

29
00:01:16,670 --> 00:01:19,070
and it has a lot of follow
ups. And as you will see,

30
00:01:19,070 --> 00:01:22,045
my slides will be a series
